codex
Committed `6a8e6d6` on `gauntlet/loop`. Clean worktree. No push.

Duplicate IDs let updates affect only the first `i1`, leaving another queued ([crucible.rs:141](/Users/stas/Playground/slag/.claude/worktrees/lane-loop/slag-rs/src/crucible.rs:141)). The forge fetched the cracked first match for that queued ID ([forge.rs:206](/Users/stas/Playground/slag/.claude/worktrees/lane-loop/slag-rs/src/pipeline/forge.rs:206)). The duel’s `.max(1)` forced another paid round after heat exhaustion ([duel.rs:102](/Users/stas/Playground/slag/.claude/worktrees/lane-loop/slag-rs/src/pipeline/duel.rs:102)).

The fix rejects duplicate IDs, enforces re-smelt state, blocks terminal ingots, and stops scheduling passes without progress.

Files changed under `slag-rs/`:

- `src/crucible.rs`
- `src/pipeline/forge.rs`
- `src/pipeline/resmelt.rs`
